# Plot the fatband without LO-TO splitting
crystod --phonon-fatband --poscar 221_PPOSCAR_ScF3 --dim 4 4 4

Space group: Pm-3m (#221)
k-path (seekpath): $\Gamma$-X-M-$\Gamma$-R-X  R-M

Computing phonon band structure with eigenvectors (306 q-points)...
Fatband for Sc written to: fatband_Sc.pdf
Fatband for F written to: fatband_F.pdf



# Plot the fatband with LO-TO splitting
crystod --phonon-fatband --poscar 221_PPOSCAR_ScF3 --dim 4 4 4 --nac 

NAC (LO/TO splitting) enabled: Born effective charges read from BORN.
Space group: Pm-3m (#221)
k-path (seekpath): $\Gamma$-X-M-$\Gamma$-R-X  R-M

Computing phonon band structure with eigenvectors (306 q-points)...
Fatband for Sc written to: fatband_nac_Sc.pdf
Fatband for F written to: fatband_nac_F.pdf
